{"updated_at": {"date": {"d": "29", "m": "07", "Y": "2026"}, "time": {"H": "04", "M": "56", "S": "53"}}, "news": [{"title": "BMC clears removal of 126 trees for Powai SRA project; developer to provide 4,000 PAP homes", "para": "The BMC Tree Authority approved removing 126 trees for a Powai slum rehabilitation project.  This decision followed the developer's commitment to provide over 4,000 free rehabilitation flats.  Officials surveyed the site and identified 144 trees, with 126 affected by construction.  The authority permitted felling 44 trees and transplanting 82 others.  This new approval supersedes an earlier one due to redevelopment layout changes.", "href": "https://realty.economictimes.indiatimes.com/news/residential/bmc-approves-cutting-126-trees-for-powai-slum-rehabilitation-project-promises-4000-free-homes/132700440?utm_source=newslisting&utm_medium=latestNews", "img": "data:image/png;base64, ", "img-src": "https://etimg.etb2bimg.com/thumb/img-size-2000207/132700440.cms?width=150&height=112", "tag": "residential"}, {"title": "Chandigarh reviews online tenancy portal ahead of launch", "para": "Chandigarh administration reviewed an online Tenancy Portal for upcoming rules.  The portal will facilitate registration of tenancy agreements and UIN generation.  It aims to formalize the rental housing sector and resolve disputes efficiently.  Officials were directed to ensure the portal is user-friendly and accessible.  The new tenancy rules are expected to streamline rental processes for residents.", "href": "https://realty.economictimes.indiatimes.com/news/technology/chandigarhs-new-online-tenancy-portal-set-to-transform-rental-agreements/132700368?utm_source=newslisting&utm_medium=latestNews", "img": "data:image/png;base64, ", "img-src": "https://etimg.etb2bimg.com/thumb/img-size-817314/132700368.cms?width=150&height=112", "tag": "technology"}, {"title": "Bhubaneswar civic body to intensify action against building plan violations ahead of SC hearing", "para": "